{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d2f27563-c71c-815e-9919-5639a520dee1",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T12:36:37-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Timothy Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:33:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen Haskell. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:33:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Timothy Burdick. I wish to report a noise disturbance, and I would be obliged if you could tell me whether this is the correct office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:33:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Noise complaints, yes, I can take that down for you. Let me just pull up the form. Go ahead, Mr. Burdick, tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:33:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a group of motorcyclists who gather outside every evening and rev their engines. It is loud, and it goes on for a good while after supper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:33:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every evening. Okay. And how long has this been happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:33:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It has been going on since Monday. That would be the evening the snow turned to rain, so this is now the fourth evening running."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:33:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, and then last night. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct. And I expect it will be again this evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. About what time do they usually start?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Shortly after five o'clock, as a rule. They continue until perhaps eight, sometimes a little later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Five to eight, roughly. Let me write that. Do you know how many bikes we're talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would say five or six. I have not counted precisely. It is difficult to see them from the house, but one can certainly hear them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Now, I need a location for the report. Where are they gathering?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:39-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would prefer not to give my own address on this call. I can describe the location only generally, in the lot near the end of my street. Kindly note that I would like the report taken regardless."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay. I can note it as a general location for now. If the police or the enforcement office need more, they'd likely follow up and ask you for the exact spot. Is that alright with you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:35:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That will be acceptable. I can be reached at four oh one, five five five, zero one six three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:35:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, zero one six three. Got it. Is that a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:35:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is. I am on it now, in the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:35:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll keep that short then. Is there anything else you want in the report? Any plates, jackets, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:35:36-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing of that kind. I will mention only one thing. I have taken to driving the long way home each evening, to avoid the left turn at the corner near them. It is a tricky turn, and with the bikes pulling out, I do not care to attempt it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:35:55-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense, I'll put that in so they understand it's affecting traffic as well. So that's a report of a group of motorcycles revving every evening since Monday, five to eight or so, five or six bikes. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:36:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You did. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:36:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll send this along to the right people today. I can't tell you exactly when someone will be out, but it's on record as of now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:36:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Kindly let them know I am available at that number. Thank you for your time, Mr. Haskell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:36:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Burdick. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:36:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon."
    }
  ],
